summary:
  Today's radiology news highlights advancements in AI for Alzheimer's, ongoing business lobbying efforts within the radiology field, and research on the long-term effects of fitness and lifestyle choices. Several articles also cover emerging health trends and the potential of natural food sources.

top_stories[8]{title,source,url,category,importance,ai_summary}:
  Title: "Scientists identify OTULIN as a key trigger of tau buildup in Alzheimer's"
  Source: ScienceDaily Health
  URL: https://www.sciencedaily.com/releases/2026/01/260116035348.htm
  Category: neuro
  Importance: 95
  ai_summary: "Researchers pinpointed OTULIN, an immune-regulating enzyme, as a primary driver of tau protein accumulation in the brain, offering a novel therapeutic target for Alzheimer's disease."
