  Title: "A 47-year study reveals when fitness and strength start to fade"
  Source: ScienceDaily Health
  URL: https://www.sciencedaily.com/releases/2026/01/260116035336.htm
  Category: msk
  Importance: 80
  ai_summary: "A long-term study reveals that physical fitness and strength typically begin to decline around age 35, although later-in-life exercise can still significantly improve physical capacity."
  Title: "An endocrinologist tried a new weight loss approach and it worked"
  Source: ScienceDaily Health
  URL: https://www.sciencedaily.com/releases/2026/01/260116035317.htm
  Category: abdomen
  Importance: 75
  ai_summary: "A new primary care approach called PATHWEIGH, which focuses on patient-requested weight management, successfully halted population weight gain in a large-scale trial."
  Title: "Scientists are rethinking bamboo as a powerful new superfood"
  Source: ScienceDaily Health
  URL: https://www.sciencedaily.com/releases/2026/01/260116035313.htm
  Category: abdomen
  Importance: 70
  ai_summary: "A review of research suggests bamboo shoots possess significant health benefits, including blood sugar control, heart and gut health support, and anti-inflammatory properties."
  Title: "Researchers found a tipping point for video gaming and health"
  Source: ScienceDaily Health
  URL: https://www.sciencedaily.com/releases/2026/01/260116035311.htm
  Category: neuro
  Importance: 65
  ai_summary: "Heavy video gaming (over 10 hours/week) is associated with poorer health outcomes in young people, highlighting the importance of balancing screen time with other activities."

